WEBVTT

00:00:00.690 --> 00:00:03.050
Now, the exchange of rings!

00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:05.980
I attack with Kirara, boosted by Tough Boy!

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:10.440
Wedding hold!

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:19.020
This isn't quite what I had in mind...

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:21.440
But maybe this isn't so bad...

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:23.170
Miss Emi?

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:27.510
Goal in!

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:04.230
Well, Kamui, since you lost to me, we're 
getting married like you promised, right?!

00:02:04.230 --> 00:02:06.760
Where shall we go on our honeymoon?

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:08.830
I've always wanted to sail on the Seven Seas!

00:02:08.830 --> 00:02:10.900
No! I don't wanna marry you!

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:13.910
Your new house will be on 
a hill overlooking the sea.

00:02:13.910 --> 00:02:16.390
Let's move!

00:02:16.390 --> 00:02:18.030
Not a chance!

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:22.580
T-True, I did lose to you!

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:25.430
But Team Q4 hasn't lost!

00:02:25.430 --> 00:02:27.160
So our agreement is still up in the air!

00:02:29.050 --> 00:02:32.910
I see. Whichever team wins two 
matches first wins the tournament.

00:02:32.910 --> 00:02:37.760
We lost the first match to Team Handsome, but 
there's no way Kai will lose the second one...

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:39.590
That'll make it a tie.

00:02:39.910 --> 00:02:41.880
Huh? Then...

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:44.600
The match after that one, 
my win or loss, decides it?!

00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:48.920
I beg you, Brother! Please beat Gouki!

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:04.560
It's a successful defense!

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:05.620
Resurrection!

00:03:05.880 --> 00:03:07.750
This is it!

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:10.880
Everything is sacrificed 
to the Malevolent Soul...

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:13.540
of the Immortal God of Destruction!

00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:20.860
M-Misaki...

00:03:21.390 --> 00:03:23.490
I-I really think you should 
play instead of me.

00:03:24.460 --> 00:03:25.940
What are you saying?

00:03:25.940 --> 00:03:29.940
Well, if I do play as scheduled, 
and Team Q4 loses because of me...

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:32.060
You said you'd stay in 
it to the end, remember?

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:34.360
Th-That's right, I did...

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:47.640
The Hidden Message

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:49.930
It's the regional tournament finals...

00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:52.540
And let's move on to the second match!

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:54.000
Good Luck, Team Handsome

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:56.260
W-What should I do?

00:03:56.260 --> 00:04:00.340
What should you do?! Brother, 
please do your best!

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:03.430
My future with Miss Emi is on the line!

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:06.190
I can't do it! I know I can't!

00:04:06.190 --> 00:04:09.430
Aichi's totally freaking out!

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:11.640
Oh, Aichi!

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:15.730
All right! I, Katsumi Morikawa, 
will stand in for him!

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:16.860
You can't!

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:19.320
What the heck?! Don't 
shoot me down in harmony!

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:24.050
For one thing, you're not registered as a 
team member, so it's out of the question!

00:04:24.050 --> 00:04:26.120
OOTQ!

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:27.410
I don't blame him.

00:04:28.150 --> 00:04:31.310
All this time, he's been 
dependent on the team,

00:04:31.310 --> 00:04:33.780
but now it's his responsibility 
whether they win or lose.

00:04:33.780 --> 00:04:35.080
Who wouldn't panic?

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:39.890
When you put it that way... It's like, if 
they sold stress, he'd be all stocked up.

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:46.030
From the team that can't lose 
again, Team Quadrafolio...

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:47.890
Or Q4, for short...

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:49.550
Toshiki Kai!

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:54.500
I know! If I left here...

00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:56.760
I'm sure Misaki would fill in...

00:04:56.760 --> 00:05:00.500
I would never fight a guy 
who ran away, even once.

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:06.600
What's <i>he</i> talking about?!

00:05:09.610 --> 00:05:14.690
...Versus Kaoru (Ka-boom) 
Komatsubara from Team Handsome!

00:05:14.690 --> 00:05:16.590
Is that really part of his name?

00:05:16.590 --> 00:05:19.840
Yes! Ka-boom!

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:22.420
Okay, Ka-boom!

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:24.700
Let's blow it up!

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:28.700
Rip off that guy's mask of cockiness!

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:30.450
Yes, ka-boom!

00:05:30.450 --> 00:05:31.940
If you lose...

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:34.080
you're gonna eat a thousand sea urchins!

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:36.190
Ka-boom?!

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:40.160
Please do your best, Mr. Kai!

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:42.910
Kamui the Great's fate is in your hands!

00:05:42.910 --> 00:05:44.830
Jeez! "<i>Mr.</i> Kai"?!

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:46.210
What the heck is that?!

00:05:46.210 --> 00:05:49.440
Everyone, cheer him on! EC, yo!

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:50.320
Forget it!

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:55.860
Until the jerk honestly admits that I'm 
the strongest Cardfighter there is,

00:05:55.860 --> 00:05:58.080
there's absolutely no way 
I'm gonna root for him!

00:05:58.350 --> 00:06:02.090
Kai! Get outta there and let me take over!

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:04.340
What were you just told?! It's impossible!

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:06.870
This guy's a riot!

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:12.460
I have to cheer for him?!

00:06:12.460 --> 00:06:16.300
Naturally! After all, your fate's 
in his hands, isn't it...

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:17.390
Mr. Husband?

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:22.570
Give it all you've got!

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:29.750
For a four-leaf clover, Quadrafolio 
still has a long way to go.

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:30.700
Kai...

00:06:31.340 --> 00:06:33.870
The second match of the regional 
championship final fight...

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:35.860
Let's start!

00:06:35.860 --> 00:06:38.880
Stand up, the Vanguard!

00:06:35.860 --> 00:06:38.880
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:06:41.720 --> 00:06:43.100
In this second match,

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:47.730
Kai is playing with a Kagero deck, and 
Ka-boom is playing with a Granblue deck!

00:06:47.730 --> 00:06:49.670
What a great match-up!

00:06:49.670 --> 00:06:51.920
This is so boring!

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:54.450
Just be patient until the awards ceremony.

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:58.080
After we give flowers to the 
winning team, our work is done.

00:06:58.080 --> 00:07:00.040
The winning team, huh?

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:02.690
Hey, do you think that boy has a chance?

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:04.460
I'm not really interested anyway.

00:07:04.460 --> 00:07:08.230
Oh, Kourin, you're saying things like that again?!

00:07:11.920 --> 00:07:15.640
I would never fight a guy 
who ran away, even once.

00:07:17.930 --> 00:07:22.760
After all, it would be way better 
if Misaki switched with me.

00:07:23.480 --> 00:07:27.600
I mean, Kai must know that I'll lose...

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:32.060
Ka-boom of Team Handsome is going first!

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:40.940
I draw!

00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:44.060
I ride Samurai Spirit, ka-boom!

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:50.880
When a Granblue unit goes 
to the Vanguard Circle,

00:07:50.880 --> 00:07:55.120
Guiding Zombie can move to a 
rear-guard circle, ka-boom!

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:57.930
That's the end of my turn.

00:07:57.930 --> 00:08:00.800
You've gotten to the finals, 
so you're a pretty good player,

00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:04.880
but against a guy like me, who has 
experience playing at the <i>nationals</i>, you're no match!

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:07.630
I'm gonna win this match real quick, ka-boom!

00:08:10.850 --> 00:08:12.190
It's my turn.

00:08:13.480 --> 00:08:14.310
Draw.

00:08:15.770 --> 00:08:18.200
I ride the Embodiment of Armor, Bahr.

00:08:20.630 --> 00:08:22.310
When another Kagero unit

00:08:22.630 --> 00:08:25.980
enters the Vanguard circle, 
the Lizard Soldier, Conroe,

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:27.660
moves to a rear-guard circle.

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:31.280
I call two Iron Tail Dragons.

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:40.460
Attack Samurai Spirit!

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:46.900
Damage trigger check, ka-boom!

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:48.960
Conroe gives a boost!

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:50.840
Bahr attacks!

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:56.450
Drive trigger check.

00:08:57.800 --> 00:09:00.230
Got a critical trigger!

00:09:00.230 --> 00:09:02.180
Bahr gains +1 Critical.

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:04.680
He does 2 damage!

00:09:08.340 --> 00:09:10.380
Ka-boom! That came out of nowhere!

00:09:10.380 --> 00:09:11.610
Wake up!

00:09:14.300 --> 00:09:16.410
Iron Tail attacks!

00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:19.750
Skeleton Lookout, ka-boom!

00:09:26.700 --> 00:09:28.260
My turn ends.

00:09:32.690 --> 00:09:34.450
This is awesome!

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:38.890
In just the second turn, 3 points of damage 
have been delivered to last year's winning team!

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:40.610
It was a fast and furious attack!

00:09:40.610 --> 00:09:43.270
Huh?! Sounds like things 
are popping out there!

00:09:43.490 --> 00:09:46.230
Kai, making his debut here 
with this impressive match,

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:48.600
is receiving roars of 
approval from the crowd!

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:50.930
I'm not surprised!

00:09:50.930 --> 00:09:53.540
He <i>is</i> the strongest Cardfighter after me!

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:55.910
Nobody believe him!

00:09:55.910 --> 00:09:57.290
NB, yo!

00:09:57.750 --> 00:09:59.500
Those little brats...!

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:01.240
Well, they <i>are</i> right.

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:04.370
Kai lives up to expectations, doesn't he?

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:07.020
What, <i>that's</i> no big deal...

00:10:07.020 --> 00:10:09.230
Doin' great!

00:10:09.700 --> 00:10:11.700
Kai really is great...

00:10:12.270 --> 00:10:14.250
Compared to him, I'm...

00:10:33.240 --> 00:10:35.250
What are you <i>doing</i>?!

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:37.830
If you lose, I mean it, it'll 
be a thousand sea urchins!

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:41.830
D-Don't worry! He just caught 
me off guard, ka-boom!

00:10:43.030 --> 00:10:45.860
O-Or rather, think of it as me 
giving him a courtesy, ka-boom?!

00:10:45.860 --> 00:10:48.120
Hiroshi, prepare the sea urchins!

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:50.290
Now I'm psyched, ka-boom!

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:54.170
Now it's <i>my</i> turn!

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:57.860
I'm gonna show you the power of 
a national tournament fighter!

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:05.490
At the bottom of the deep blue sea, 
where even sunlight doesn't reach,

00:11:05.490 --> 00:11:07.460
there are undead pirates!

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:09.950
That's...

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:14.870
The doomed souls of these pirates, 
along with their ship...

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:16.670
I ride, ka-boom!

00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:28.770
I call Samurai Spirit, Ruin Shade, 
and the Dandy Guy, Romario, ka-boom!

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:34.750
I attack with Ruin, boosted by Romario!

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:36.300
I attack Bahr!

00:11:37.530 --> 00:11:39.450
Then I activate Ruin's skill!

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:42.760
I put the top two cards from 
my deck into the Drop Zone,

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:46.350
and Ruin gets +2000 added to her power 
until the end of the battle, ka-boom!

00:11:47.070 --> 00:11:48.770
Go-go-go!

00:11:52.510 --> 00:11:53.650
Here I go!

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:57.070
Drive check!

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:01.030
Ka-boom!

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:02.370
Check.

00:12:04.340 --> 00:12:06.110
I'm not done yet, ka-boom!

00:12:06.110 --> 00:12:10.190
I attack with Samurai Spirit, 
boosted by Guiding Zombie!

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:16.430
It's gonna be 3 damage?!

00:12:16.430 --> 00:12:18.470
What the heck is he doing?!

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:22.070
No guard.

00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:29.630
Now this is what you'd expect from 
last year's winner, Team Handsome!

00:12:29.630 --> 00:12:34.850
He returned Team Q4's furious attack 
with a fierce attack of his own!

00:12:35.090 --> 00:12:38.320
Yes! Now they have 3 damage, too!

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:40.490
He caught up quickly, right?

00:12:40.490 --> 00:12:40.980
Yeah!

00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:47.170
You get it now?! That's the power of 
somebody who's played at nationals, ka-boom!

00:12:47.940 --> 00:12:50.030
Yeah, I get it.

00:12:50.030 --> 00:12:52.870
I get that there's nothing I 
can gain from you, either.

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:54.160
There he goes!

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:57.570
So he's finally done warming up, huh?

00:12:57.570 --> 00:12:59.870
Nothing you can gain from me?!

00:12:59.870 --> 00:13:03.430
You've got nerve, sayin' that to a 
guy who plays at the national level!

00:13:03.430 --> 00:13:07.880
I know you're frustrated that you're no 
match for us, but those are some sour grapes!

00:13:07.880 --> 00:13:11.200
His coolness is second only to Kamui!

00:13:12.250 --> 00:13:16.570
Darn that Kai! If he loses 
after talking big like that...

00:13:16.570 --> 00:13:20.750
I'll do this and this to 
him and go like this...

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:21.790
Kai...

00:13:26.140 --> 00:13:27.070
Draw.

00:13:27.960 --> 00:13:30.550
I ride the Dragon Knight, Nehalem!

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:40.540
I move Iron Tail Dragon.

00:13:40.860 --> 00:13:44.790
I call Chain-attack Sutherland 
and Gattling Claw Dragon!

00:13:50.520 --> 00:13:54.320
I activate the Iron Tail 
Dragon's Counterblast twice!

00:13:54.320 --> 00:13:58.020
The Dragon has +2000 power 
until the end of this turn.

00:13:58.380 --> 00:14:03.230
Then Iron Tail Dragon receives a 
boost from Gattling Claw Dragon...

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:05.570
and attacks Captain Nightmist!

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:14.850
Next, Nehalem attacks, boosted by Conroe!

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:19.170
Check.

00:14:23.080 --> 00:14:24.400
5 damage?!

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:27.310
Boosted by Iron Tail Dragon...

00:14:27.310 --> 00:14:29.700
Chain-attack Sutherland attacks!

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:32.590
Romario guard!

00:14:32.590 --> 00:14:35.620
And then Ruin Shade intercepts!

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:44.270
Turn end.

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:45.410
Ka-boom!

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:50.110
It's a series of fast and furious attacks!

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:51.780
Ka-boom has successfully defended!

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:55.090
What are you gonna do next, Ka-boom, 
now that it's down to the wire?!

00:14:55.090 --> 00:14:57.620
Ka-boom! Now it rubbed off on me! Ka-boom!

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:00.870
"Successfully defended"? The 
guy's skating on thin ice!

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:02.130
TI, yo!

00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:06.830
A-At this rate, I'm up the creek!

00:15:06.830 --> 00:15:09.890
Me, the guy who played at nationals...

00:15:09.890 --> 00:15:11.050
Sea urchins!

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:11.870
Ka-boom!

00:15:12.440 --> 00:15:14.120
1,000!

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:18.690
Oh, woe is me, ka-boom!

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:24.830
Wait a sec... <i>I</i> scored 3 points 
of damage on my first attack, too!

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:28.360
I'm gonna finish the 
match this turn, ka-boom!

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:33.130
I ride Spirit Exceed, ka-boom!

00:15:35.230 --> 00:15:37.690
I call Skeleton Lookout!

00:15:39.860 --> 00:15:42.920
Captain Nightmist's Counterblast!

00:15:48.350 --> 00:15:50.820
Resurrect, Nightmist!

00:15:53.380 --> 00:15:56.030
With the Counterblast, he got to 
take it out of the Drop Zone...

00:15:56.030 --> 00:15:57.050
I know this move...

00:15:57.050 --> 00:16:02.440
Ready?! It's Gouki's surefire 
Infinite Resurrection Hell, ka-boom!

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:15.240
Nightmist, boosted by Samurai Spirit, 
attacks your Nehalem, ka-boom!

00:16:16.020 --> 00:16:18.280
The Embodiment of the Spear, Tahr, defends!

00:16:22.380 --> 00:16:24.570
Next, I attack with Exceed!

00:16:26.640 --> 00:16:27.890
No guard.

00:16:32.610 --> 00:16:35.070
Why isn't he protecting himself?!

00:16:35.070 --> 00:16:36.130
Why?!

00:16:44.930 --> 00:16:46.230
Picture it.

00:16:49.460 --> 00:16:53.700
Maybe Kai is trying to tell me something...

00:16:57.830 --> 00:16:58.910
Picture it...

00:17:17.040 --> 00:17:18.350
Kai...

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:20.030
Twin Drive!

00:17:23.130 --> 00:17:25.730
Ka-boom! No trigger, huh?

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:27.980
But I still have one attack!

00:17:29.200 --> 00:17:30.190
Go for it.

00:17:31.670 --> 00:17:34.200
I will go for it, ka-boom!

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:35.790
With a boost from Romario...

00:17:35.790 --> 00:17:38.520
Skeleton Lookout attacks!

00:17:43.970 --> 00:17:45.250
No guard.

00:17:45.590 --> 00:17:46.580
Kai!

00:17:54.940 --> 00:17:55.930
Kai?!

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:01.370
Why didn't you protect yourself?!

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:15.250
It's not like you didn't protect yourself.

00:18:15.250 --> 00:18:17.610
You knew you would win 
without protecting yourself.

00:18:19.150 --> 00:18:20.960
This makes us even, 5-5.

00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:26.010
All I have to do is get through the next 
turn, and victory will definitely be mine, ka-boom!

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:33.340
W-Why...?

00:18:36.020 --> 00:18:37.850
The arrow fell short of the mark...?

00:18:39.920 --> 00:18:41.300
Final turn!

00:18:42.130 --> 00:18:44.560
F-Final turn, you say?!

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:46.290
Get real, ka-boom!

00:18:46.290 --> 00:18:52.270
I'm gonna last through this turn and then 
I'm gonna get my team to the nationals, ka-boom!

00:18:56.730 --> 00:18:57.780
Draw!

00:18:59.640 --> 00:19:02.160
I ride Blazing Flare Dragon!

00:19:12.090 --> 00:19:15.040
I activate Gattling Claw 
Dragon's Counterblast!

00:19:15.520 --> 00:19:19.620
It retires one of my opponent's grade 0 rear-guard units from the field!

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:22.060
My Skeleton Lookout...

00:19:26.480 --> 00:19:28.350
Gattling Claw moves to the Soul.

00:19:30.300 --> 00:19:33.090
I activate Blazing Flare Dragon's skill.

00:19:33.720 --> 00:19:36.140
When your opponent's card has 
been moved to the Drop Zone,

00:19:36.140 --> 00:19:38.570
the Dragon's power increases by 
+3000 until the end of the turn.

00:19:39.090 --> 00:19:40.300
What?!

00:19:40.300 --> 00:19:42.540
On top of that, I activate 
Sutherland's skill.

00:19:42.540 --> 00:19:45.920
With this one, too, when your opponent's 
card has been moved to the Drop Zone,

00:19:45.920 --> 00:19:48.130
Sutherland's power increases by +3000.

00:19:48.130 --> 00:19:50.330
And then I call Bahr!

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:56.380
I attack with Blazing 
Flare, boosted by Conroe!

00:19:59.100 --> 00:20:01.320
N-No! I can't defend myself!

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:03.510
Twin drive check.

00:20:03.510 --> 00:20:04.870
First...

00:20:04.870 --> 00:20:05.870
Second...

00:20:06.870 --> 00:20:09.620
Got a double critical trigger!

00:20:11.360 --> 00:20:12.960
Is he a demon?!

00:20:12.960 --> 00:20:14.310
The demon's too strong!

00:20:33.050 --> 00:20:35.480
The winner is Toshiki Kai!

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:44.430
The winner of the second match of the final 
round of the regional championship tournament...

00:20:44.430 --> 00:20:48.600
is Team Q4! A brilliant victory!

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:49.880
Overkill!

00:20:49.880 --> 00:20:52.420
That kid was pretty amazing, y'know?

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:03.150
He saw through it all...

00:21:03.610 --> 00:21:05.340
His opponent's ability...

00:21:05.340 --> 00:21:06.990
Maybe right from the beginning...?

00:21:07.860 --> 00:21:12.080
He really is incredible. I'm not 
even close to being in his league.

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:16.870
But I wanna get strong like 
you, and then fight you again!

00:21:17.510 --> 00:21:21.130
And yet, here I was, thinking only 
about losing or running away...

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:23.310
That doesn't do any good!

00:21:26.330 --> 00:21:27.970
Ya know...

00:21:28.620 --> 00:21:30.190
Weren't you overdoing it?

00:21:30.190 --> 00:21:33.400
I bet you freaked out Aichi there even more.

00:21:33.870 --> 00:21:35.300
Not quite.

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:41.770
So you're going last, huh?

00:21:43.010 --> 00:21:45.370
Th-This time, I'm not gonna lose!

00:21:45.910 --> 00:21:46.610
There you go!

00:21:46.880 --> 00:21:48.220
Huh?

00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:49.690
Aichi...

00:21:52.400 --> 00:21:53.660
Brother...

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:57.300
Aichi! If you lose this, you'll be sorry!

00:21:57.300 --> 00:21:59.300
That's not encouraging!

00:21:59.300 --> 00:22:01.540
He's already under a lot of pressure...

00:22:01.540 --> 00:22:04.380
But it's a good pressure.

00:22:04.650 --> 00:22:06.990
All right, it's time for the 
regional tournament final match!

00:22:06.990 --> 00:22:09.400
Laugh or cry, this is it!

00:22:09.400 --> 00:22:12.230
The last battle!

00:22:14.750 --> 00:22:15.890
Stand up...

00:22:16.530 --> 00:22:17.910
Vanguard!

00:23:51.000 --> 00:23:52.440
Overkill, huh?

00:23:52.440 --> 00:23:55.200
Well? Did you understand his message?

00:23:55.200 --> 00:23:57.080
Huh? You knew, Misaki?

00:23:57.080 --> 00:23:59.110
That Kai sent me a message...

00:23:59.110 --> 00:24:00.800
Hooray for male bonding, right?

00:24:00.800 --> 00:24:01.820
Right...

00:24:01.820 --> 00:24:04.590
But the pressure keeps piling on...

00:24:04.590 --> 00:24:06.640
Do your best. You're a boy, aren't you?

00:24:06.640 --> 00:24:08.280
You too, Misaki?

00:24:08.280 --> 00:24:10.020
My opponent is <i>Gouki</i>!

00:24:10.420 --> 00:24:12.760
Next time: Rematch in the Final Match!

00:24:12.760 --> 00:24:15.280
When I close my eyes, I picture 
them right in front of me...

00:24:15.280 --> 00:24:18.980
Zombies! The undead! Ghosts!
